      <p class="eyebrow">Plans and pricing</p>
      <h1>Simple to start. <em>Built around you.</em></h1>
      <p class="lede">Everyone starts the same way: free, then the Vault Keys membership. From there, choose how you want to be coached.</p>
    </div></div></section>
    <section class="sec" style="padding-top:20px"><div class="wrap">
      <div class="member"><div><p class="tag">Step one for everyone</p><h3>The Vault Keys membership</h3><p>A Vault Key every morning, the full coaching year in the <a href="/writing/#letters">Vault Keys archive</a>, and a live coaching call with Russ every month. Every way to be coached includes it.</p></div><div class="member-price"><div class="price">$99<small>/mo</small></div><p class="guarantee">Your first week is on us. Cancel any time.</p><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/fZu8wP9Jl9fO1d2dqU6Na00">Begin · first week free</a></div></div>
      <div class="sec-head" style="margin-top:56px"><p class="eyebrow">Then add a way to be coached</p><h2>Five ways to be coached.</h2></div>
      <div class="plans"><div class="plan"><h3>One on one</h3><div class="price">$999<small>/mo</small></div><p>Three private 60-minute sessions a month with Russ, messages between sessions, and the Vault Keys membership included: a key every morning and the live monthly call.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="https://buy.stripe.com/28E00jaNpfEc3la9aE6Na02">Begin one on one</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a group</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your group</div><p>Groups of 5 to 10, meeting twice a month. Bring your own group or join one. It starts with a free conversation.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a family</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your family</div><p>Family sessions together and a check-in for each person, priced by family size. It starts with a free conversation.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a team</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your team</div><p>Priced by team size, goals and length. Most engagements run three to six months. It starts with a free conversation.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div><div class="plan"><h3>As a business</h3><div class="price price-word">Built for your business</div><p>Leadership and team coaching, plus Vault Keys for your people at a volume rate. It starts with a free conversation.</p><p class="plan-cta"><a class="btn btn-line" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call</a></p></div></div>
      <p class="offers-note">Every plan starts the same way: a free 30-minute call with Russ. Prices in US dollars, billed monthly.</p>
    </div></section>
    <section class="sec final"><div class="wrap"><h2>Not sure which fits?</h2><p class="lede">Thirty minutes with Russ, free. He'll help you choose.</p><div class="ctarow"><a class="btn btn-acc" href="/book/">Free 30-minute call with Russ</a></div></div></section>
